    "dsl": "(exists ?book (exists ?pliers (exists ?phone (exists ?glasses (and (Is ?book 'book') (Is ?pliers 'pliers') (Is ?phone 'phone') (Is ?glasses 'glasses') (OnTopSide ?book) (LeftOf ?pliers ?book) (RightOf ?phone ?book) (RightOf ?glasses ?phone))))))",
    "cnf": "(exists ?book (exists ?pliers (exists ?phone (exists ?glasses (and (Is ?book 'book') (OnTopSide ?book) (LeftOf ?pliers ?book) (RightOf ?phone ?book) (Is ?pliers 'pliers') (Is ?phone 'phone') (RightOf ?glasses ?phone) (Is ?glasses 'glasses'))))))",
    "k": 4,
    "object_classes": [
        "book",
        "phone",
        "pliers",
        "glasses"
    ]
}